    "sentence_translations": [
      "The leader who loves to praise himself",
      "",
      "At our company there is a leader who likes to praise his own work every time we have a meeting.",
      "We all can't stand it.",
      "",
      "One day when we were having a meeting and that leader was once again bragging, ..",
      ".. one of my colleagues said: “Manager Zhang, could you not always praise yourself?”",
      "",
      "Everyone went silent, and I thought to myself: he's done for!",
      "How dared he talk to the leader like that.",
      "",
      "Unexpectedly, the colleague then added: “That way, we have no chance to praise you even if we want to...”"
    ]
